# Build-context control for experiments/render/Dockerfile.
#
# The Render service is configured with Root Directory = repo root (so the
# Dockerfile can COPY the app's own files), which means this whole folder is
# the Docker build context. Without this file the context would include the
# local virtualenv, the portable build and — worst of all — real books and
# API keys. Nothing here is needed to *run* the app.
.venv/
dist-portable/
build-assets/
docs/
Export-Colour-Examples/
books/
.git/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
local_settings.json
prompts.local.json
# Key bundles hold real API keys; on Render they come from the
# REXTBOOKS_KEY_BUNDLES env var instead of a baked-in file.
key_bundles.json
error.log
*.log
